"content": "<h1>該南</h1><ol><li><p>亞法撒的兒子（<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"42003036\" data-end-ref=\"42003036\">路3:36</data>；<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"01010024\" data-end-ref=\"01010024\">創10:24</data>〔七十士譯本〕，<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"01011012\" data-end-ref=\"01011013\">11:12–13</data>）。</p></li><li><p>亞當的曾孫，也稱為該南（Kenan）（<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"01005009\" data-end-ref=\"01005014\">創5:9–14</data>；<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"13001002\" data-end-ref=\"13001002\">代上1:2</data>；<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"42003037\" data-end-ref=\"42003037\">路3:37</data>）。</p><p><em>見</em><data class=\"resource-ref\" data-content-id=\"5714\" data-resource-code=\"AquiferOpenBibleDictionary\">該南</data>。</p></li></ol>",
